      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. No page bar: the title, the Space tabs, then the content with its Runs panel on the right.\n2. A view lists its own Run Types in step order.\n3. Each Run Type declares several Skills, including its View context Skill; its card lists them.\n   Resume, Rerun, Copy and + New Run only copy a prompt.\n4. Run names are run-<operation>-<target>; the file id rlNN_… shows on hover; a rerun adds -2.\n5. An item and its runs pick each other: a build, a round, a discussion.\n6. runs/ and results/ sit beside labeling/; Workflow and All runs open from ?drawer=.\n7. An empty slot stays blank: no dash, no \"not implemented\".",
      "originalText": "1. No page bar: the title, the Space tabs, then the content with its Runs panel on the right.\n2. A view lists its own Run Types in step order.\n3. Each Run Type declares several Skills, including its View context Skill; its card lists them.\n   Resume, Rerun, Copy and + New Run only copy a prompt.\n4. Run names are run-<operation>-<target>; the file id rlNN_… shows on hover; a rerun adds -2.\n5. An item and its runs pick each other: a build, a round, a discussion.\n6. runs/ and results/ sit beside labeling/; Workflow and All runs open from ?drawer=.\n7. An empty slot stays blank: no dash, no \"not implemented\".",
